        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 472.18,
          "end": 476.08299999999997,
          "en": "So where I return Navigation like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 477.85,
          "end": 480.4,
          "en": "And it's the Root component which we render here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 480.4,
          "end": 483.08,
          "en": "between AuthContextProvider",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 483.08,
          "end": 484.74,
          "en": "and therefore, in the Root component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 484.74,
          "end": 486.97,
          "en": "we can use our AuthContext",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 486.97,
          "end": 488.96,
          "en": "and get our AuthContext here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 488.96,
          "end": 492.07,
          "en": "And now we just need to authenticate the user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 492.07,
          "end": 494.32,
          "en": "which we can do by using authCtx.authenticate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 495.74,
          "end": 498.72,
          "en": "to which we forward our storedToken,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 498.72,
          "end": 501.25,
          "en": "just as we did it for logging in manually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 501.25,
          "end": 502.13,
          "en": "Now we're doing it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 502.13,
          "end": 504.33,
          "en": "with the token we fetched from AsyncStorage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 506.43,
          "end": 508.1,
          "en": "Now, the advantage of this approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 508.1,
          "end": 511.8,
          "en": "is now that we can now use the AppLoading component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 511.8,
          "end": 514.02,
          "en": "which you saw earlier in the course already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 514.02,
          "end": 516.03,
          "en": "to prolong the loading screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 516.03,
          "end": 518.093,
          "en": "until we're done fetching this token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 519.64,
          "end": 522.5,
          "en": "To do this, we need to install another package.",
