        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 532.18,
          "end": 535.113,
          "en": "And wait for this installation to finish here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 537.45,
          "end": 540.109,
          "en": "And once this finished, once we installed this package,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 540.109,
          "end": 544.56,
          "en": "we can import AppLoading from expo-app-loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 544.56,
          "end": 547.95,
          "en": "and use the component in our Root component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 547.95,
          "end": 549.67,
          "en": "So here we now wanna find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 549.67,
          "end": 551.67,
          "en": "whether we're done loading or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 551.67,
          "end": 554.21,
          "en": "So if we did fetch our token or not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 554.21,
          "end": 555.4,
          "en": "and to control that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 555.4,
          "end": 558.59,
          "en": "we can add some state here with useState,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 558.59,
          "end": 560.94,
          "en": "which is imported from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 560.94,
          "end": 563.463,
          "en": "And we could name this isTryingLogin",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 567.1,
          "end": 568.15,
          "en": "and setIsTryingLogin.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 569.54,
          "end": 570.81,
          "en": "And initially, this is true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 570.81,
          "end": 574.02,
          "en": "because we are trying to log the user in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 574.02,
          "end": 576.29,
          "en": "But then here once we're done fetching the token,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 576.29,
          "end": 578.65,
          "en": "no matter if we did find the token or not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 578.65,
          "end": 581.4,
          "en": "either way, we are done trying to log in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 581.4,
          "end": 582.93,
          "en": "so we can set this to false then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 582.93,
          "end": 584.8,
          "en": "because we are no longer trying",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 584.8,
          "end": 586.18,
          "en": "to log the user in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 586.18,
          "end": 590.8,
          "en": "And we can use this is trying to login state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 590.8,
          "end": 594.59,
          "en": "to return AppLoading whilst we are still trying it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 594.59,
          "end": 596.51,
          "en": "And AppLoading, when returned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 596.51,
          "end": 599.593,
          "en": "will ensure that the splash screen is prolonged.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 600.62,
          "end": 602.53,
          "en": "So if we switch to this approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 602.53,
          "end": 606.31,
          "en": "instead of using useEffect directly in the AuthContext,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 606.31,
          "end": 608.113,
          "en": "we can get rid of that flickering.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 609.27,
          "end": 612.4,
          "en": "Now if I close this app here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 612.4,
          "end": 615.55,
          "en": "and I then restart it here on iOS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 615.55,
          "end": 618.43,
          "en": "we should immediately end up on the welcome screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 618.43,
          "end": 620.81,
          "en": "after this loading screen here, this screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 620.81,
          "end": 621.643,
          "en": "Here we go.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 622.82,
          "end": 625.26,
          "en": "And if I do log out, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 625.26,
          "end": 627.47,
          "en": "and I then close this app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 627.47,
          "end": 631.38,
          "en": "and I then restart, we should end up on the login screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 631.38,
          "end": 632.74,
          "en": "after the loading screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 633.64,
          "end": 635.48,
          "en": "because no token was found",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 635.48,
          "end": 638.66,
          "en": "and therefore, we are not logged in automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
          "start": 638.66,
          "end": 640.919,
          "en": "However, actually this failed here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 224,
          "start": 640.919,
          "end": 643.94,
          "en": "because we do still have a token stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 225,
          "start": 645.23,
          "end": 647.13,
          "en": "because when I log out here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 226,
          "start": 647.13,
          "end": 650.68,
          "en": "we do clear the token but only in AuthContext,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 227,
          "start": 650.68,
          "end": 655.12,
          "en": "just as before, we only set it in AuthContext.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 228,
          "start": 655.12,
          "end": 658.19,
          "en": "Now we also want to clear the token in AsyncStorage",
