        },
        {
          "id": 231,
          "start": 663.4,
          "end": 666.13,
          "en": "And to do this, we can use AsyncStorage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 232,
          "start": 666.13,
          "end": 668.347,
          "en": "and use the removeItem method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 233,
          "start": 669.369,
          "end": 671.91,
          "en": "And remove the token here in the logout function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 234,
          "start": 671.91,
          "end": 674.46,
          "en": "in our AuthContextProvider component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 235,
          "start": 674.46,
          "end": 677.393,
          "en": "so that we clear the token once we logged out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 236,
          "start": 678.71,
          "end": 681.16,
          "en": "With that, if we now reload this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 237,
          "start": 681.16,
          "end": 685.8,
          "en": "and I do log out, if we now close this app here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 238,
          "start": 685.8,
          "end": 687.42,
          "en": "and we then restart it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 239,
          "start": 687.42,
          "end": 690.08,
          "en": "we will end up on the login screen again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 240,
          "start": 690.08,
          "end": 691.43,
          "en": "after the loading screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 241,
          "start": 692.37,
          "end": 695.05,
          "en": "because now we don't have any token stored",
